Conditional Constructs:
1) Single Iteration: if & its family, switch
2) Multi Iteration : Loops

Relational Operators: >, <, >=, <=, ==, !=

Syntax of if Condition:
if(condition)
{
  //statement
}

Syntax of if-else Condition:
if(Condition)
{
  //statement1
}
else
{
  //statement 2
}

Syntax of if-else if Condition:
if(Condition 1)
{
  //statement 1
}
else if(condition 2)
{
  //statement 2
}
else
{
  //statement 3
}

-There is no ';' after condition.
- n no. of else-if conditions can be taken.

Logical operators:
1) AND - &&
 - && only works when 2 conditions are True(1)
 Eg: cond1 && cond2
     (5>1) && (5<10)
     output: True(1)
2) OR - ||
- || only works when either one of the statement is True(1)
 Eg: cond1 || cond2
     (5<1) || (5>4)
     output: True(1)
